/**
 * KEEB SHOP
 * 
 * Airtable setup (add to your .env):
 *   AIRTABLE_API_KEY=patXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
 *   AIRTABLE_BASE_ID=appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
 *   AIRTABLE_TABLE_NAME=Rewards   (optional, defaults to "Rewards")
 *
 * Expected Airtable columns:
 *   Name (text), Description (long text), Cost (number),
 *   Rarity (single select: COMMON | RARE | EPIC | LEGENDARY | EXCLUSIVE),
 *   Category (single select: KEYCAPS | SWITCHES | TOOLS | ACCESSORIES | EXCLUSIVE),
 *   Image (attachment — first attachment used), ImageURL (text fallback),
 *   Meta (text, optional — e.g. "1522 claimed")
